  {
   "id": "idempotent-commit",
   "label": "Committer 幂等",
   "layer": "L7",
   "group": "conn",
   "summary": "提交发生在 Checkpoint 之后，Checkpoint 里记不下「已提交」；恢复后会再提交一次，所以 Committer 必须能识别并跳过已提交的事务。",
   "lessons": [
    {
     "title": "八·下：Sink 与 exactly-once",
     "link": "/bigdata/flink/post-08b"
    },
    {
     "title": "踩坑 #06 exactly-once 还重复",
     "link": "/bigdata/flink/pitfall-06"
    }
   ],
   "lab": "去掉幂等检查：同样的故障，重复了一整个事务（12～13 条）。"
  },
  {
   "id": "retry-later",
   "label": "retryLater 重试",
   "layer": "L7",
   "group": "conn",
   "summary": "Committer 调用 retryLater() 后，Flink 在同一次完成通知里立即同步重试，默认 10 次，用完就让作业失败。",
   "lessons": [
    {
     "title": "八·下：Sink 与 exactly-once",
     "link": "/bigdata/flink/post-08b"
    },
    {
     "title": "踩坑 #08 retryLater 不会稍后",
     "link": "/bigdata/flink/pitfall-08"
    }
   ],
   "conf": [
    "sink.committer.retries = 10（默认）"
   ],
   "lab": "11 次调用在几毫秒内全部用完。"
  },
  {
   "id": "filesink-rolling",
   "label": "FileSink 滚动策略",
   "layer": "L7",
   "group": "conn",
   "summary": "Row 格式默认不到 128MB 不在 Checkpoint 时关闭文件，要等按时间滚动（检查定时器每 60 秒一次），数据要一两分钟后才可见。",
   "lessons": [
    {
     "title": "八·下：Sink 与 exactly-once",
     "link": "/bigdata/flink/post-08b"
